Baize bot rule library, version 1

This file accompanies bot-rules.json, an unchanged offline copy of the Baize
standard edition rule library at src/server/bot-rules.json (baseline f26db98).
Source: https://github.com/bocmiao/baize-analytics/blob/f26db98/src/server/bot-rules.json

License: AGPL-3.0-only, the same license as the Baize repository. See the LICENSE
included in the distribution. Rule version, rule IDs, categories and literal
tokens are preserved so PHP packages do not depend on the Node source tree.
